249
00:14:57,300 --> 00:14:58,540
This means three things:

250
00:14:58,540 --> 00:15:02,329
I will continue making videos, but I will
never be able to make money with them.

251
00:15:02,329 --> 00:15:06,459
Secondly, I can't never again become a partner
